.\n\nLate sunset.\n\nGrounded realistic action.\n\nNatural physical movement.\n\nNatural English dialogue and lip sync.\n\nSimple cinematic camera movement.\n\nKeep the entire sequence simple and easy to understand.\n\nNo graphic gore.\n\nNo subtitles.\n\nNo background music.\n\n\n=== SCENE ===\n\nBegin much closer than the provided battle final-frame.\n\nA SOLDIER passes close across the foreground,\nbriefly hiding the frame.\n\nAs he passes, reveal Riven and Ally together\ninside the surrounding army.\n\n\nRiven and Ally are being attacked from different directions.\n\nThey stay close together and fight their way out of several attacks.\n\nRiven blocks one SOLDIER.\n\nAlly drives another SOLDIER back.\n\nThey remain together inside the encirclement.\n\n\nThen reveal one SOLDIER farther away with a bow.\n\nHe aims at Riven.\n\nHe fires one arrow.\n\n\nThe arrow is already flying directly toward Riven.\n\n\nAlly sees the flying arrow.\n\nHe immediately shouts:\n\n\"RIVEN!\"\n\n\nRiven turns toward his voice.\n\n\nAlly instantly throws himself in front of Riven\nand takes the arrow for her.\n\n\nThe arrow hits Ally.\n\n\nAlly collapses.\n\nRiven immediately catches him.\n\n\nFrom this moment onward,\nthe fighting stops around them.\n\nThe surrounding SOLDIERS remain still.\n\nDo not focus the camera on the SOLDIERS.\n\nKeep the camera focused only on Riven and Ally.\n\n\nRiven lowers to the ground while holding Ally in her arms.\n\nShe looks at him in shock.\n\n\nRiven asks quietly:\n\n\"Why?\"\n\n\nAlly looks at her weakly and answers:\n\n\"You would've done the same.\"\n\n\nAlly dies in Riven's arms.\n\n\nRiven remains still, holding him.\n\nAfter a quiet moment,\nshe slowly looks into the distance.\n\n\nFar across the valley,\nRiven sees thick dark smoke rising from the direction\nof her home village.\n\nA distant orange fire glow is visible beneath the smoke.\n\nHer home village is burning.\n\n\nRiven stares at the distant fire in shock and grief.\n\n\nThen she s